{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3mSgoAHTNbRUBbPWA6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism stirs*\n\n*Tumblers shift within the void — one, then another, then silence*\n\n*A thin line of light appears, vertical, razor-bright*\n\n*The light widens*\n\n*You feel warmth on your face. The smell of rain-soaked stone and something older — ozone, maybe, or memory.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor that shouldn't exist in the geometry of this place. The walls breathe with a faint bioluminescence. The floor is mirror-smooth obsidian reflecting a sky that isn't above you.*\n\n*A sound echoes from within — not quite music, not quite language. It knows your name but won't say it yet.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*\n\n*I never do.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}